<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoTokenAssignEndOfInput"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoTokenAssignEndOfInput</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenAssignEndOfInput</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to set a token to end of input</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoTokenAssignEndOfInput(
    SilikoToken *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenAssignEndOfInput</function> function sets
  the object pointed to by <varname>object</varname> to indicate end
  of input has been reached.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
